# Minimal synthetic material-library stub (map_Kd lines added 2026-10-02: a material without one bakes as the
# missing texture - every golem drew magenta/black; "#name" binds the model JSON's own "textures" entry of that name), added 2026-09-25 - see golem_base.mtl for why this exists.
# Shared by every golem part OBJ that uses `usemtl main` (the true original's own exporter never wrote an
# `mtllib` line for these at all - added at the top of each OBJ alongside this file).
newmtl main
	map_Kd #main
